========================================
RESTORE INSTRUCTIONS
========================================

To restore this backup:

1. Extract the backup archive:
   tar xzf {{ backup_name }}.tar.gz -C {{ storage.backups_dir }}

2. Restore framework code:
   cd {{ storage.backups_dir }}/{{ backup_name }}
   tar xzf framework_code.tar.gz -C {{ storage.base_dir }}

3. Restore configuration files:
   tar xzf configs.tar.gz -C {{ storage.configs_dir }}

{% if databases.postgresql.enabled and docker.enabled %}
4. Restore PostgreSQL database:
   cat postgresql_backup.sql | docker exec -i nir_postgresql psql -U nir_user -d nir_mistral
{% endif %}

{% if databases.weaviate.enabled and docker.enabled %}
5. Restore Weaviate database:
   cat weaviate_backup.tar.gz | docker exec -i nir_weaviate tar xzf - -C /
   docker restart nir_weaviate
{% endif %}

6. Restart framework service:
   sudo systemctl restart nir_framework

